jo aapne suna"}, {"t": "02:20", "text": "Ki aapko life mein kya chahiye"}, {"t": "02:23", "text": "Kuch nahi suna maine, theek hai?"}, {"t": "02:29", "text": "Achha, ego bhi hai aapke andar"}, {"t": "02:32", "text": "Toh tere andar ho sakta hai, mere andar nahi"}, {"t": "02:36", "text": "Haan?"}, {"t": "02:38", "text": "Toh tumhare andar khud ego ho sakti hai, mere andar nahi hai"}, {"t": "02:42", "text": "Nahi mere andar ego nahi hai, main toh samarpan ke liye taiyaar hoon"}, {"t": "02:45", "text": "Nahi hai?"}, {"t": "02:46", "text": "Tumhare baat baaton se pata chal raha hai, hai ki nahi"}, {"t": "02:49", "text": "Main toh samarpan kar sakta hoon, aap kar sakte ho samarpan?"}, {"t": "02:55", "text": "Aapke andar bahut ego hai"}, {"t": "02:59", "text": "Kya?"}, {"t": "03:00", "text": "Aap samarpan kar sakte ho kisi cheez ko?"}, {"t": "03:03", "text": "Samarpan? Yeh kya hoti hai?"}, {"t": "03:06", "text": "Samarpan means"}, {"t": "03:08", "text": "Nahi samajh"}, {"t": "03:09", "text": "De dena"}, {"t": "03:11", "text": "De dena?"}, {"t": "03:13", "text": "Haan"}, {"t": "03:15", "text": "Kya de dena?"}, {"t": "03:26", "text": "Kya de dena means? Samarpan means aisa hota hai ki bhai"}, {"t": "03:31", "text": "Video call pe aaoge?"}, {"t": "03:32", "text": "Dedications"}, {"box_2d": [03:34", "text": "Video call pe aaoge?"}, {"t": "03:37", "text": "Kis liye aaunga video call pe? Mujhe sex mein interest nahi hai"}, {"t": "03:42", "text": "Achha"}, {"t": "03:45", "text": "Matlab interest nahi hai, aisa nahi ki main nalla hoon, aisa nahi hai, main matlab"}, {"t": "03:52", "text": "But aap kuch chand paison ke liye kaam kar rahe ho, barabar hai?"}, {"t": "03:57", "text": "Haan, main"}, {"t": "03:58", "text": "Kitne kitne dunga main? Kitne dunga main aapko? 300 rupaye dunga, 400 rupaye dunga, 500 rupaye dunga"}, {"t": "04:06", "text": "Haan, theek hai"}, {"t": "04:07", "text": "Toh 1 crore dekhe hai kabhi life mein aapne?"}, {"t": "04:11", "text": "Kya?"}, {"t": "04:12", "text": "Agar aapko 1 crore rupaye dekhe life mein kabhi?"}, {"t": "04:15", "text": "Kyun dekhungi? Sirf aapke paas hai kya?"}, {"t": "04:19", "text": "Nahi nahi, aapne de sakte ho na"}, {"t": "04:22", "text": "Kyun?"}, {"t": "04:26", "text": "300 rupaye mein aap body dikha rahe ho sabko, theek hai?"}, {"t": "04:31", "text": "Main? Tumhe kaise pata main apni body dikha rahi hoon?"}, {"t": "04:35", "text": "Toh video call karke kya dikhaoge aap?"}, {"t": "04:39", "text": "Toh video call pe sirf body dikhana hoti hai kya? Baat nahi kar sakte kya?"}, {"t": "04:43", "text": "Nahi"}, {"t": "04:44", "text": "Tumhare itni gandi soch, tum aise gandi soch kaise la sakte ho, haan? Video call pe sirf woh dikhane ke liye video call karte hai kya? Iska matlab aap family ke saath kisi ke saath bahar gaye ho, aapke bachche hai, aapke family ne aapko apne maa baap apne maa baap ne aapko khol ke video call apne bachche ke liye bachche ko dekhne ke liye, toh woh log kya apna chhoot dikhane ke liye aapko video call karega kya, haan?"}, {"t": "05:07", "text": "Baat karne se pehle na 100 baar soch lo, aise gandi gandi baatein mere yahan pe leke mat aao, main is dost app pe dost banane ke liye aayi hoon, koi randi ka kaam karne nahi, theek hai?"}, {"t": "05:19", "text": "Toh hum baat bhi kar sakte hai na, toh aapne video call ka kyun bola? Is par bhi video call kar sakte ho, nahi nahi nahi"}, {"t": "05:25", "text": "Abey, abey, abey, main dar rahi hoon, main dar rahi hoon, maine video call isliye bola tha, kyunki video call pe mujhe zyada coin milta hai, toh maine thodi na bola hai, main main mera chhoot dikhaungi, box dikhaungi, mujhe video call karo, aisa vagera"}, {"t": "05:41", "text": "Dekho agar aapko aapko aapko aapko, bolo toh baat karne mein interest nahi hai na, toh woh app se chale hi jao, theek hai?"}, {"t": "05:48", "text": "Aapne WhatsApp video call bola, theek hai?"}, {"t": "05:51", "text": "Toh maine ganda video call thodi na kiya hai, agar aapne aapki maa ne aapko call kiy